{"title":"Aug 5 — Haeundae Day","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Aug 5 — Haeundae Day"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Wednesday · August 5, 2026 · Day 11 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Haeundae Day 🏖️</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Sky Capsule · Dwaeji Gukbap · Haedong Yonggungsa Temple · Haeundae Sunset · Busan</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug05\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug05').setView([35.1720, 129.2000], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 L7 Haeundae by Lotte Hotels', lat:35.1620, lng:129.1601, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=L7+Haeundae+by+Lotte+Hotels+Busan' },\n    { name:'Sky Capsule & Blueline Park 🚡', lat:35.1637, lng:129.1856, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Haeundae+Blueline+Park+Sky+Capsule+Busan' },\n    { name:'Dwaeji Gukbap 🍲 (Pork soup)', lat:35.1580, lng:129.1620, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dwaeji+Gukbap+Haeundae+Busan' },\n    { name:'Haedong Yonggungsa Temple 🏯', lat:35.1878, lng:129.2230, c:'#C62828', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Haedong+Yonggungsa+Temple+Busan' },\n    { name:'Haeundae Beach (sunset) 🌅', lat:35.1587, lng:129.1604, c:'#FFA726', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Haeundae+Beach+Busan' },\n    { name:'Fresh Seafood Dinner 🦞', lat:35.1590, lng:129.1630, c:'#2E7D32', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=fresh+seafood+restaurant+Haeundae+Busan' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Breakfast — L7 Haeundae</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-05T07:00\" data-lat=\"35.1620\" data-lng=\"129.1601\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">07:00–10:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">INCLUDED ✓</span><span class=\"tag meal\">🍳 Breakfast Buffet</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Floating Restaurant — Breakfast Buffet</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Signature buffet with healthy dishes made from fresh seasonal ingredients and Busan local delicacies. Located on the <strong>2F</strong>.\n      <table style=\"margin-top:8px;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px\">\n        <tr style=\"background:#f5f5f5\"><th style=\"padding:4px 8px;text-align:left\">Type</th><th style=\"padding:4px 8px;text-align:right\">Adult</th><th style=\"padding:4px 8px;text-align:right\">Child</th></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px\">Breakfast</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;text-align:right\">₩30,000</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;text-align:right\">₩22,000</td></tr>\n      </table>\n      <ul style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n        <li>Hours: <strong>07:00–10:00</strong> — don't miss closing time</li>\n        <li>Breakfast included in your booking — no extra charge</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=L7+Haeundae+by+Lotte+Hotels+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 L7 Haeundae</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/L7해운대바이롯데호텔\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — Sky Capsule</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-05T09:00\" data-lat=\"35.1637\" data-lng=\"129.1856\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag note\">📅 Book 1 month ahead</span><span class=\"tag activity\">🚡 Ride</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Sky Capsule — Haeundae Blueline Park</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Pastel-coloured glass pod trains that ride along a coastal rail above the sea cliffs. One of Busan's most iconic and photogenic experiences. Capacity is very limited — <strong>book well in advance</strong> at the Haeundae Blueline Park website.\n      <ul>\n        <li>~2.7km coastal route from Mipo to Cheongsapo</li>\n        <li>Pods seat 2 people, ~30 min round trip</li>\n        <li>Best views looking out to sea on the left side going northbound</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Haeundae+Blueline+Park+Sky+Capsule+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Sky Capsule</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해운대블루라인파크+스카이캡슐\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Lunch</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-05T12:00\" data-lat=\"35.1580\" data-lng=\"129.1620\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">12:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍲 MUST EAT</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">DWAEJI GUKBAP!!!!!</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Busan's most iconic dish — pork soup with rice (돼지국밥). A thick, milky white pork bone broth with tender pork slices and rice. Season with fermented shrimp (새우젓) and green onion. Find a local spot near Haeundae. Gukje Market area has classic joints but local ones near the beach are also good.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=dwaeji+gukbap+돼지국밥+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find Gukbap</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/돼지국밥+부산\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Temple</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-05T14:30\" data-lat=\"35.1878\" data-lng=\"129.2230\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">14:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🏯 Temple</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Haedong Yonggungsa Temple</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Rare and stunning Buddhist temple built directly on seaside cliffs. Dragons, pagodas, and golden Buddhas overlooking crashing waves — one of Korea's most dramatic temple settings. ~30 min from Haeundae by taxi/bus.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Enter through the stone archway at the top and descend to the sea level temple</li>\n        <li>Best visited in afternoon when morning crowds thin</li>\n        <li>Souvenir stalls and fish-shaped bread (붕어빵) at the entrance</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Haedong+Yonggungsa+Temple+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Haedong Temple</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해동용궁사\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Evening</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card evening\" data-dt=\"2026-08-05T18:30\" data-lat=\"35.1587\" data-lng=\"129.1604\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">18:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🌅 Sunset</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Haeundae Beach Sunset</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Watch the sun set over Haeundae Beach with the Marine City skyscrapers as a silhouette. The beach lights up beautifully at dusk. Perfect for golden-hour photos.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Haeundae+Beach+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Haeundae Beach</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해운대해수욕장\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-05T19:30\" data-lat=\"35.1590\" data-lng=\"129.1630\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🦞 Dinner</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Fresh Seafood Dinner</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Busan is Korea's seafood capital. Options near Haeundae:\n      <ul>\n        <li>Live lobster / king crab hot pot</li>\n        <li>Raw fish platter (회) with wasabi and perilla leaves</li>\n        <li>Grilled squid (오징어구이)</li>\n        <li>Spicy seafood stew (해물탕)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=fresh+seafood+restaurant+Haeundae+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Seafood Restaurants</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해운대+해산물+맛집\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Sky Capsule booking:</strong> Book online at the Haeundae Blueline Park website — usually opens reservations ~1 month in advance. Very limited capacity. Time slots sell out fast.</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Wednesday · August 5, 2026 · Day 11 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Haeundae Day 🏖️</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Sky Capsule · Dwaeji Gukbap · Haedong Yonggungsa Temple · Haeundae Sunset · Busan</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug05\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug05').setView([35.1720, 129.2000], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 L7 Haeundae by Lotte Hotels', lat:35.1620, lng:129.1601, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=L7+Haeundae+by+Lotte+Hotels+Busan' },\n    { name:'Sky Capsule & Blueline Park 🚡', lat:35.1637, lng:129.1856, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/sear